{"about_the_game":"Charge through 30 quirky, abstract stages, in this 5th generation inspired twin stick space shooter. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970840/extras/6ffb24e498de63db44115d4d7512e99a.poster.avif?t=1707990266\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970840/extras/6ffb24e498de63db44115d4d7512e99a.webm?t=1707990266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970840/extras/6ffb24e498de63db44115d4d7512e99a.mp4?t=1707990266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate this unconventional universe with branching paths to uncover it's many secrets. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970840/extras/fac5d07dff0ea1cd9808e65cc9766243.poster.avif?t=1707990266\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970840/extras/fac5d07dff0ea1cd9808e65cc9766243.webm?t=1707990266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970840/extras/fac5d07dff0ea1cd9808e65cc9766243.mp4?t=1707990266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dynamic difficulty will keep gameplay fresh as you unlock new challenges and power ups along your ever evolving journey.<br>Bring the loot you've collected to your local space garage to create parts to customize your cruiser! You could even bring a buddy into the mix for some couch co-op action! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970840/extras/1e0cb005c6e00bb02f3373bf79ecd45f.poster.avif?t=1707990266\" wi